solution.p:
To undo multiplication by a fraction, we can multiply my its reciprocal.
\begin{aligned}
{{\frac{1}{6}}k} \amp= {{\frac{8}{7}}}\\
\multiplyleft{{6}}{{\frac{1}{6}}k} \amp= \multiplyleft{{6}}{{\frac{8}{7}}}\\
k \amp= {{\frac{48}{7}}}
\end{aligned}
The solution set is {\left\{\frac{48}{7}\right\}}\text{.}

